      "result_description": "Rainham CC, Essex - 4th XI - Win",
      "result_applied_to": "241235",
      "match_notes": "<p>RCC&nbsp;4th&nbsp;XI&nbsp;lost&nbsp;the&nbsp;toss&nbsp;and&nbsp;was&nbsp;put&nbsp;to&nbsp;bat.&nbsp;The&nbsp;team&nbsp;had&nbsp;a&nbsp;decent&nbsp;start&nbsp;by&nbsp;Charlie&nbsp;Vickers&nbsp;and&nbsp;Hari&nbsp;Patel.&nbsp;Team&nbsp;was&nbsp;struggling&nbsp;at&nbsp;91&nbsp;for&nbsp;3&nbsp;when&nbsp;Samir&nbsp;walked&nbsp;in.&nbsp;Bobby&nbsp;and&nbsp;Samir&nbsp;had&nbsp;98&nbsp;run&nbsp;partnership&nbsp;which&nbsp;helped&nbsp;put&nbsp;a&nbsp;challenging&nbsp;total&nbsp;of&nbsp;249&nbsp;runs.&nbsp;A&nbsp;cracking&nbsp;knock&nbsp;by&nbsp;Bobby&nbsp;(108&nbsp;not&nbsp;out)&nbsp;which&nbsp;was&nbsp;equally&nbsp;supported&nbsp;and&nbsp;complemented&nbsp;by&nbsp;Samir&nbsp;(53&nbsp;runs).&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>First&nbsp;innings&nbsp;summary&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>RCC&nbsp;4th&nbsp;XI&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Rayleigh&nbsp;5th&nbsp;XI&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bobby&nbsp;Little&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>108*&nbsp;(4s&nbsp;-16,&nbsp;6s&nbsp;-&nbsp;1)&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>J&nbsp;Coleman&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2-52&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Samir&nbsp;Patel&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>53&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(4s&nbsp;-11,&nbsp;6s&nbsp;-&nbsp;0)&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>James&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2-38&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Chasing&nbsp;the&nbsp;target&nbsp;of&nbsp;250&nbsp;runs,&nbsp;Rayleigh&nbsp;5th&nbsp;XI&nbsp;had&nbsp;a&nbsp;steady&nbsp;start.&nbsp;S.&nbsp;Lennox&nbsp;played&nbsp;an&nbsp;anchor&nbsp;inning&nbsp;of&nbsp;47&nbsp;runs&nbsp;but&nbsp;kept&nbsp;losing&nbsp;wickets&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;other&nbsp;end.&nbsp;D.&nbsp;Bond&nbsp;did&nbsp;try&nbsp;to&nbsp;get&nbsp;team&nbsp;over&nbsp;the&nbsp;line&nbsp;with&nbsp;an&nbsp;innings&nbsp;of&nbsp;56&nbsp;runs&nbsp;but&nbsp;it&nbsp;was&nbsp;too&nbsp;little&nbsp;too&nbsp;late&nbsp;to&nbsp;win&nbsp;the&nbsp;match&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;home&nbsp;team.&nbsp;Samir&nbsp;had&nbsp;an&nbsp;economic&nbsp;spell&nbsp;of&nbsp;8&nbsp;overs&nbsp;with&nbsp;2&nbsp;maidens&nbsp;and&nbsp;1&nbsp;wicket.&nbsp;1&nbsp;wicket&nbsp;each&nbsp;was&nbsp;also&nbsp;bagged&nbsp;by&nbsp;Charlie&nbsp;Sutton,&nbsp;Mayur,&nbsp;and&nbsp;Leo.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>First&nbsp;innings&nbsp;summary&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Rayleigh&nbsp;5th&nbsp;XI&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>RCC&nbsp;4th&nbsp;XI&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Duncan&nbsp;Bond&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>56&nbsp;(4s&nbsp;-&nbsp;9,&nbsp;6s&nbsp;-&nbsp;0)&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Samir&nbsp;Patel&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1-17&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Simon&nbsp;Lennox&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>47&nbsp;(4s&nbsp;-&nbsp;8,&nbsp;6s&nbsp;-&nbsp;0)&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Leo&nbsp;Fezvi-Hunt&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1-19&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
